## Underlying poll data

The approval and disapproval figures compiled in `data/aprobacion_presidencial.csv`
are the intellectual property of their respective pollsters (Cadem, Criteria,
Activa Research, Panel Ciudadano-UDD, TuInfluyes.com, Black & White, and
others). They are reproduced here solely for informational and research
purposes, with attribution to each source. No claim of ownership over the
underlying data is made.
